,"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1399","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c33936","characterName":"大鳥 静香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c33936"},"originalCharacterName":"大鳥 静香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shizuka is a famous pianist that's attending a very strict private music all-girls high school and lives in a dormitory that's constantly guarded against anybody who wants to go outside or come inside. She has a quiet and reserved type of personality and due to her circumstances - she doesn't know very much about the outside world. It's needless to say that because of all of that she doesn't have any actual experiences interacting with men and she is in those ages where young women seek their first lovers. She might just get a chance to experience something new once she meets Takuya who was sent on a quest by his friend Daisuke to sneak into her reclusive dormitory and take a picture of her. Will their encounter bear fruit to true love?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33936"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b68de058035494098a13e2b5e4ac1489207b6b690d7bfd502bdac5da89ed7fb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/865043991adf7ee540f03842c2e7f6482e1689f13398fcaa062386d9ba4638a4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊藤 瞳子","creatorId":"vndb:s2000","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2000","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2000","name":"真木 碧","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1403","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63679","characterName":"寺田","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63679"},"originalCharacterName":"寺田","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Terada is the gym teacher at Miyanomori High School. Takuya has always been wary of him due to his strict and disciplinarian nature. The old PE teacher's also a very nasty pervert with no moral compass on how to behave at times. Due to Takuya's trouble with switching his gender all too often, he might really need to pay attention not to allow himself to get noticed by the lecherous teacher."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63679"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/12f40ccafcb7e30f21e6731f24274af78388300020257b6198181d6b5e14813d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/625b5618be3a42c3e7277c2ce0c4a0f362ead29d0573a5178f70339b418c1a64.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63680","characterName":"松永 啓子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63680"},"originalCharacterName":"松永 啓子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The lecherous school nurse of Miyanomori High School, Keiko, is there to comfort any and all students who come to her infirmary. Whether they need somebody to assist them relieve their stress or if they need to hear a couple of words of wisdom, Keiko is always eager to help out her students. Takuya is one of those students who seem to be only interested in the latter, so once he transforms into a girl again this year, he will eagerly seek out his favourite high school nurse."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63680"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af9168f8cad3563a136579bd30e682c5067f4a296d7f2057c1f3fa51a53931e9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23eaa93d88b3f730e2aa2c39b1c142191fddac5eb52a9b313a7182c5ea2cbb23.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63681","characterName":"大介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63681"},"originalCharacterName":"大介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daisuke is Takuya's and Asuka's classmate. He is a friendly type of guy that likes to chat with Takuya often at school. He also has a hobby of taking and collecting photos of famous women he is interested in. There's only one girl that he's missing from his collection and that's Ootori Shizuka. Since it's very hard to get an entry into her high school dormitory, Daisuke will ask of Takuya's female form to sneak into and take a photo of Shizuka with his camera."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63681"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/4186a75f29ab904e2eb394eebd06140dfc61a2f4d0844ecb6634887829ba9a9b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/456b7bbf6507add438b1c6848164cf1bca84a33ac5bea5f306c8ca0f9282ecea.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63682","characterName":"佐藤 麻美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63682"},"originalCharacterName":"佐藤 麻美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asami used to be Takuya's senpai and his mentor as the school's chemistry club president. Since last year, she has graduated from Miyanomori High School and now she is enrolled at an university in a different town. She was the only scientist that was able to turn female Takuya back into a man again. Once again, her expertise in chemistry is needed because Takuya has this year as well gotten himself turned into a woman. But since Takuya had lost contact with her ever since she graduated, he might not be able to find her in time for her to make a cure. Instead, Takuya might have to rely only on Asami's old rival, Chisato, as she is the only scientist that is reachable at the moment."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63682"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f23b5c883c1bb3ce2da158dc1a59d9ea49185f3ee64feaa5c95747e01e98bdd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/352600da6ce72e2ed63eaaaf750274da2f42adad41a8f0f8e03fbe207d095688.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63683","characterName":"大村","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63683"},"originalCharacterName":"大村","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Oomura-sensei is the homeroom teacher of Takuya's and Asuka's class. She also acts as a student's club adviser for Miyuki's drama club. She is a new teacher that came as a substitute for the old teacher, Miyamura Hiroshi. Her mellow and approachable type of personality will come in handy once Takuya transforms into a girl again this year."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63683"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/9358232efdf4f3209f8a1a0f8dcbd82f5cc0c0ab747a0b4e98d0e65017d0a27a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02f1c56d00e360a2b8d5ca3330121f6b8dd38974eb20227f0eb5289d3ead9546.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63684","characterName":"五郎 佐野","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63684"},"originalCharacterName":"五郎 佐野","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sano is a substitute teacher at Miyanomori High School. He has a keen interest in all young women and due to a prank love letter made by Daisuke and Yumiko, he fell in love with Takuya. Little does he realize that Takuya's actually a man. He just might find that out a little too late."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63684"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bd47df5f564ff3bd1a5d7ef5c4ea20d8f318dd8f3625327a46510bc073f0ba1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7bfe3fb7d214a7fa7f546da3cf07bc8aca5155a004204b80f2f1637b67f7b71.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63685","characterName":"小林 翔","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63685"},"originalCharacterName":"小林 翔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shou is Takuya's neighbour that has a lethargic attitude towards studying. He is a kind of kid that likes to play RPG games on his handheld console all day long. Due to that, his studying problems became so grave that his father had to employ a private tutor for him in order to motivate him to study."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The new tutor's bound to have some trouble with him for sure."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63685"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/8942863643796e11494153a2374c667546a060fe093be102ab11abbbf74b8faa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08fc19c8d4d0269ea616bf4eb82f44573e19ba5c71aa753f2695701483dece81.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63686","characterName":"由美子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63686"},"originalCharacterName":"由美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yumiko is Takuya's and Asuka's classmate. She's a local know-it-all gossipy type of girl that has info on all students and new events at school and she's also good friends with Asuka. Takuya on the other hand seems to not like her that much and considering her personality, that might not be strange at all. After all, it seems that maybe she also kind of dislikes him as well, considering that she willingly participated and maybe even masterminded herself a plot for a prank in which female Takuya was framed for a fake love letter sent to their teacher Sano."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63686"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/360f487b7b977cf9c7a64182ae5e251e7cbb94c600922629ab57828a5d5abfbe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41ce260cfb90d5b7b94feabb4d89fb53281c332f7b3bbb53f422916df4d7e5db.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63687","characterName":"河原 千里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63687"},"originalCharacterName":"河原 千里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chisato is an inquisitive scientist and Takuya's junior in the chemistry club. She is never without an experiment in her hands. Although she looks cute, in fact she is a very dangerous lady who developed a dubious machine that she named \"Quick Revolution\". That dangerous machine transformed Takuya into a girl so now Chisato needs to develop a cure to turn him back into a boy again. She’s also on a quest to beat her old rival, Satou Asami, who successfully transformed Takuya from a girl into a boy last year so this new experiment also holds a very personal value for her as she strives to show that she's a better scientist than Asami."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63687"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26df17df54cfc1e3f1250aeaf21dfd9b974b42e51ce0eba65b013f915ee626f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cc35bdfe360b97d8a843eb490d47ac042bcfd7df9250be5e229a42ab845d85dc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎津 まお","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1400","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63688","characterName":"工藤 弘二","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63688"},"originalCharacterName":"工藤 弘二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouji used to be a very shy schoolmate from Takuya's high school but not anymore. Ever since last year's events, he has been maturing and now he has a way more easy-going and relaxed type of personality. He decided to join the chemistry club this year in order to be more closer to his crush, Takuya. His love for him hasn't waned yet and he is eagerly awaiting for the day when Takuya will transform into a woman once again. That day might just come out sooner than he originally anticipated."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63688"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f09c44aea247bd480a5b282e7e6dde1b951f8a39c60edc8ec29a4a9edf908719.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/663b07a51a03d53091cd3e347c6e1ae169c4b9743710c48adf6c9e406078beb3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63689","characterName":"相原 拓也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63689"},"originalCharacterName":"相原 拓也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aihara Takuya seems like a normal, unimpressive guy. But in truth, he is one of the most peculiar high school students out there. His uncanny ability to get into the most unimaginable troubles is an ever-puzzling dilemma that nobody can really solve. Now it looks like he is on a path to repeat one of his most bizarre adventures every year. You'd believe that once was already enough but for Takuya, it seems like he didn't really get a hint the first time. Becoming the president of the club that initially had put you into very serious trouble and then even exposing yourself as a guinea pig to random dubious experiments is the very last thing anybody with a sane mind would have thought of doing. But not Takuya, he is somewhat special and this year, he will show us how it is done again."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63689"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f57b259dc42c3e9928e5399cf7db79670b69ae3145098df4cce55a0066535306.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34b8ccd8e6c37cc01e8bb3480dda210da815d52b04a9d8c7a3b3f6f4bdfd641c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63690","characterName":"相原 たくや","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63690"},"originalCharacterName":"相原 たくや","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Once again, Takuya's misadventure of transforming himself into an opposite gender is drawing attention at Miyanomori High School. The ever-present problem with Takuya is that he never really learns from his past mistakes and it looks like he is eager to repeat them often. Last year mingling with the chemistry club didn't really bring him anything good so the reason as to why he decided to stay in it and even become its president is not known nor unterstood by anybody but him. You could say that his fellow underclassman from the chemistry club couldn't have hoped for a better guinea pig out there for her newest experiment. Will Takuya survive another girl transformation adventure is yet to be seen."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63690"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d3fe552d204a197f3cd0bf047a7d5699cc2803414952bcf2775586d26e0f02d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d19ef552ec952c1a1683382f0f3699eec471518f3348f87fcbd760c15b7c6a4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"上戸 琉","creatorId":"vndb:s263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s263","name":"儀武 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1401","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8380","characterName":"片桐 明日香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8380"},"originalCharacterName":"片桐 明日香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka is a very close childhood friend of Takuya. She became his girlfriend after their experiences from last year. She often gets angry at him but that's because she puts up with more than other girls would ever take so Takuya could consider himself to be very lucky to have her by his side. Will their relationship survive another girl transformation trouble that seem to often befall poor Takuya?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8380"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e6ab8021ac7701ce69a79d3673d885b8303a3bc6e757daa5698c3ba3b2fb6e7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e584104f3a0cce282cf7ffe24c5070b60c44631ae72e193589767966d45d7311.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"涼森 ちさと","creatorId":"vndb:s445","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s445","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s445","name":"すずき けいこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1402","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p36","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:93","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p36","name":"CROWD","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:97:93","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p36","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p36","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p36","name":"クラウド","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:11277:v128","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p36","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p36","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p36","name":"クラウド","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:11282:v128","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p267","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p267","name":"ぶる～べり～そふと","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:11283:v128","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7446","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7446","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7446","name":"Otorhin","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:129226:v128","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p16171","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p16171","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p16171","name":"VienDesu! Porting Team","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:129717:v128","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p9801","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p9801","canonica